source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A token in a heading renders as an icon.
-- input.jira --
h1. (x)
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="%28x%29"></a><img class="emoticon" src="/jira/images/icons/emoticons/error.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></h1>
-- want.md --
# :emoticon[(x)]
-- warnings.json --
[]
